n me, you won’t get very far,’’ and he glanced at the cash drawer beside him. Of course the money was old-style bills, half again as big as the money we use nowadays, and different-looking. I turned away and got out fast. There’s nothing nice about jail, even in 1894. Reprint 2026-27$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-639Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
